<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>500 - Server Error | ZIYAURA</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css" />
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-50 flex items-center justify-center min-h-screen p-6">
  <div class="max-w-md w-full text-center bg-white p-10 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
    <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-amber-50 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6 text-amber-500 text-3xl">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation"></i>
    </div>
    <h1 class="text-7xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mb-2">500</h1>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Internal Server Error</h2>
    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-8">
      Something went wrong on our end. We are working hard to resolve it. Please try again in a few moments.
    </p>
    <a href="/home" class="inline-block w-full bg-black text-white py-3.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest hover:bg-gray-800 transition-colors shadow-sm">
      Return to Homepage
    </a>
  </div>
